  "id": "quest-briar-glen-epilogue",
  "title": "What Became of Briar Glen",
  "summary": "The valley's story, told in the slides the ending leaves behind.",
  "notes": "The epilogue-slide variants of the four headline endings (bible 4.4), as data. Started when the main quest resolves. Each slide is an objective whose `activeWhen` is its selection rule, so while this quest is active the set of active objectives IS the slide list (read it with QuestRuntime.activeObjectives); the slideshow completes each slide by emitting epilogue-slide-<id>, and sets epilogue.finished to close the quest. The slide prose is in src/content/data/narration/narration-epilogue-slides.json (mw-e39.16), keyed by objective id; the `text` here is a one-line description. Objectives are listed in slideshow order. Every ending gets at least three slides, whichever of the ending facts are set; shared slides (Tansy, the abbot, Vane) sit before each ending's last slide. Harbour slides (name-stone home, the Tern's crate) are added by facts alone and never change the headline ending.",
